	(text "NOTE: Since resolution is doubled what\nour target is, we just divide by 2, i.e.\nignore FrameBufferCounter[0].\nAs well, since the image is compressed, we \nuse one bit to tick which of the two pixels\nwe are outputing"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 89.408 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6699571b-5c79-4246-bb01-0f02213b81cc")
	)
	(text "The value is \"reset\" or \"reloaded\"\nevery time VSync Updates.\nOn odd lines, the value at the beginning is stored,\non even lines, when reset the initial stored value \nis loaded in.\nWhen a reset is called for, the dlatch raises to \nHigh Impedence which leads to the reset being all 0's"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 234.696 23.876 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
